cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ink Forest, please cite it as below. If you use its data, please also cite the PRIYA simulations."
type: software
title: "Ink Forest: an interactive Lyα tomography game"
abstract: "An interactive Lyα tomography game: observe simulated Lyα forest sightlines, infer the structure between them, and revise the map. The MIT licence covers the code and documentation; the PRIYA-derived runtime data (assets/ink-forest-data.js) are excluded and redistributed with permission (see DATA.md)."
